# MySQL settings for MODIP (Rails 3.2 + mysql2 0.3.17, schema dumped from MySQL 5.5).
[mysqld]
# MySQL 5.5 defaults: no strict mode and no ONLY_FULL_GROUP_BY, which the
# application queries were written for.
sql_mode = NO_ENGINE_SUBSTITUTION
character-set-server = latin1
collation-server = latin1_swedish_ci
max_allowed_packet = 64M
max_connections = 200
skip-name-resolve
